{"sha": "658e0677725ecbbfaa6e9caf4921f1fdb855631014af93ba3da5bdfca9ee6621", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:randomvar} 章 --- 离散随机变量}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:randomvar:1}", "\\emph{二项分布：} 令 $X = \\sum_{i=1}^n X_i$，其中各", "$X_i$ 为独立的伯努利变量；$V(X_i) = \\E(X_i^2) - \\E(X_i)^2 = p - p^2$，", "且独立变量的方差相加", "（\\cref{thm:b2:randomvar:variancerules}）：", "\\[", "\\E(X) = np, \\qquad V(X) = np(1-p) .", "\\]", "\\emph{泊松分布：} $\\E\\bigl(X(X-1)\\bigr) =", "\\sum_{k\\geq2}k(k-1)e^{-\\lambda}\\frac{\\lambda^k}{k!} = \\lambda^2", "e^{-\\lambda}\\sum_{j\\geq0}\\frac{\\lambda^j}{j!} = \\lambda^2$，于是", "\\[", "V(X) = \\E(X^2) - \\E(X)^2", "= \\lambda^2 + \\lambda - \\lambda^2 = \\lambda .", "\\]", "\\emph{几何分布}（$q = 1 - p$）：对", "$\\sum_{k\\geq0}q^k = \\frac{1}{1-q}$ 在收敛圆内求导两次", "（\\cref{ch:b2:powerseries}），$\\sum_{k\\geq2}k(k-1)q^{k-2} =", "\\frac{2}{(1-q)^3}$，于是", "\\[", "\\E\\bigl(X(X-1)\\bigr) = pq\\sum_{k\\geq2}k(k-1)q^{k-2}", "= \\frac{2q}{p^2},", "\\qquad", "V(X) = \\frac{2q}{p^2} + \\frac1p - \\frac{1}{p^2}", "= \\frac{q}{p^2} = \\frac{1-p}{p^2} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:randomvar:2}", "\\emph{和：}对 $n \\in \\N$，由事件的不交性及独立性，", "\\[", "\\P(X + Y = n)", "= \\sum_{k=0}^n \\P(X = k)\\P(Y = n - k)", "= e^{-(\\lambda + \\mu)}\\frac{1}{n!}", "\\sum_{k=0}^n \\binom nk \\lambda^k\\mu^{n-k}", "= e^{-(\\lambda+\\mu)}\\frac{(\\lambda + \\mu)^n}{n!}", "\\]", "由二项式定理，$X + Y \\sim \\mathcal{P}(\\lambda + \\mu)$。", "\\emph{条件分布：}对 $0 \\leq k \\leq n$，", "\\[", "\\P(X = k \\mid X + Y = n)", "= \\frac{\\P(X = k)\\P(Y = n - k)}{\\P(X + Y = n)}", "= \\binom nk", "\\Bigl(\\frac{\\lambda}{\\lambda+\\mu}\\Bigr)^{k}", "\\Bigl(\\frac{\\mu}{\\lambda+\\mu}\\Bigr)^{n-k} ,", "\\]", "即二项分布 $\\mathcal{B}\\bigl(n,", "\\frac{\\lambda}{\\lambda+\\mu}\\bigr)$：已知总数时，每个", "事件独立地以", "与其速率成正比的概率“选择”第一个来源。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:randomvar:3}", "当还缺 $k$ 种玩具时，每个新盒子", "以概率 $\\frac kn$ 带来一种新玩具，与过去独立：", "下一种新玩具的等待时间 $W_k$ 服从几何分布，", "$\\mathcal{G}\\bigl(\\frac kn\\bigr)$，其中 $\\E(W_k) = \\frac nk$，且", "$T_n = W_n + W_{n-1} + \\dots + W_1$（第一个盒子必定带来新玩具，", "即 $W_n = 1$，与 $\\E = n/n$ 相符）。由线性性，", "\\[", "\\E(T_n) = \\sum_{k=1}^n \\frac nk = n\\sum_{k=1}^n\\frac1k", "\\sim n\\ln n ,", "\\]", "利用 $\\sum_{k\\leq n}\\frac1k = \\ln n + \\gamma + o(1)$", "（\\cref{ch:b2:comparison}）。收集最后几种玩具，才是", "真正的代价：一半的盒子都要用在最后这几种上。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:randomvar:4}", "逐点地，$X(\\omega) = \\#\\{n \\geq 1 : X(\\omega) \\geq n\\} =", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\mathbf{1}_{X \\geq n}(\\omega)$。二重族", "$\\bigl(\\mathbf{1}_{X \\geq n}(\\omega)\\,\\P(\\{\\omega\\})\\bigr)_{n,", "\\omega}$ 非负，因此族的 Fubini 定理", "（\\cref{ch:b2:series}）无条件适用：先对", "$n$ 求和得 $\\E(X)$，先对 $\\omega$ 求和得 $\\sum_n \\P(X", "\\geq n)$；二者同时有限且相等。对 $X \\sim", "\\mathcal{G}(p)$：$\\P(X \\geq n) = q^{n-1}$（$q = 1-p$），于是 $\\E(X) =", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}q^{n-1} = \\frac{1}{1 - q} = \\frac1p$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:randomvar:5}", "\\emph{对称性：}第 $i$ 个被抽出的球是", "罐中均匀随机选出的一个球（$N$ 个球中每一个都等可能地落在", "抽取顺序的第 $i$ 位上），因此 $\\P(Y_i = 1) = \\frac MN =", "p$，由线性性得 $\\E(X) = np$，无需独立性。", "", "\\emph{协方差：}对 $i \\neq j$，$\\E(Y_iY_j) = \\P(\\text{第 }", "i, j \\text{ 次均为白球}) = \\frac{M(M-1)}{N(N-1)}$（两个不同位置的有序对被均匀地赋予", "两个不同球的有序对）。由此", "uniformly). Hence", "\\[", "\\operatorname{Cov}(Y_i, Y_j)", "= \\frac{M(M-1)}{N(N-1)} - \\frac{M^2}{N^2}", "= \\frac{M(N - M)}{N^2}\\cdot\\frac{-1}{N-1}", "= -\\frac{p(1-p)}{N-1} < 0 :", "\\]", "抽到一个白球，会使其余各次抽取中的白球变得更少。", "由\\cref{thm:b2:randomvar:variancerules}，", "\\[", "V(X) = np(1-p) + n(n-1)\\Bigl(-\\frac{p(1-p)}{N-1}\\Bigr)", "= np(1-p)\\,\\frac{N - n}{N - 1} \\leq np(1-p) :", "\\]", "不放回抽样的均值相同，但方差\\emph{更小}", "比放回抽样时（仅当 $n = 1$ 时取等号），", "负相关起到了稳定作用。当 $n = N$ 时", "方差为零，此时计数是确定的。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}